Claude DesktopVS Code (Cline) <p>Add to <code>~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</code>:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "acex": {
      "command": "acex-mcp",
      "env": {
        "ACEX_API_URL": "http://localhost:8080"
      }
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Add to your Cline MCP settings:</p> <pre><code>{
  "acex": {
    "command": "acex-mcp",
    "env": {
      "ACEX_API_URL": "http://localhost:8080"
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
